2 CONC ird cousin to Emperor Gengshi, who was also descended from Liu Fa.) Liu Qin married the daughter of Fan Chong (樊重), and the couple had three sons, Liu Yan (劉縯), Liu Zhong (劉仲), and Liu Xiu, born January 15, 5 B.C.E.. Liu Qin died 
