2 CONT
2 CONT     * Children
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Liu Fei (劉肥), Prince Daohui of Qi (created 202 BC, d. 195 BC)
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Liu Ying (劉盈), Crown Prince (created 202 BC, d. 188 BC), later Emperor Hui
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Liu Jian (劉健), Prince Ling of Yan (created 202 BC, d. 181 BC)
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Liu Ruyi (劉如意), Prince Yin of Zhao (created 198 BC, d. 195 BC)
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Liu Heng (劉恆), Prince of Dai (b. 202 BC, created 196 BC, d. 157 BC), later Emperor Wen
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Liu Hui (劉惠), Prince of Liang (created 196 BC), later Prince Gong of Zhao (created 180 BC,, committed suicide 179 BC)
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Liu You, Prince of Huaiyang (created 196 BC), later Prince You of Zhao (created 194 BC), starved to death by Empress Dowager Lü 180 BC)
2 CONT
