1 CONT     * Children:[8]
1 CONT           o Liu Ju (??), Crown Prince Li (b. 128 BC, created 122 BC, d. 91 BC)
1 CONT           o Liu Fuling (???), later Emperor Zhao of Han (b. 94 BC)
1 CONT           o Liu Hong (??), Prince Huai of Qi (created 117 BC, d. 109 BC)
1 CONT           o Liu Dan (??), Prince La of Yan (created 117 BC, committed suicide 80 BC)
1 CONT           o Liu Xu (??), Prince Li of Guangling (created 117 BC, committed suicide 53 BC)
1 CONT           o Liu Bo (??), Prince Ai of Changyi (created 97 BC, d. 86 BC)
1 CONT           o Princess Zhuyi
1 CONT           o Princess Yangcheng
1 CONT           o Princess Eyi
